      "id": "f9e531a77554-q12",
      "number": 12,
      "question": "What will come in the place of &lsquo;?&rsquo; in the following equation, if &lsquo;+&rsquo; and &lsquo;&ndash;&lsquo; are interchanged and &lsquo;&times;&rsquo; and &lsquo;&divide;&rsquo; are interchanged? 25 + 3 &divide; 9 &minus;14 &times; 2 = ?",
      "questionHtml": "What will come in the place of &lsquo;?&rsquo; in the following equation, if &lsquo;+&rsquo; and &lsquo;&ndash;&lsquo; are interchanged and &lsquo;&times;&rsquo; and &lsquo;&divide;&rsquo; are interchanged?<br />\n25 + 3 &divide; 9 &minus;14 &times; 2 = ?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "7",
          "html": "7"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "5",
          "html": "5"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "12",
          "html": "12"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "0",
          "html": "0"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>Given equation: 25 + 3 ÷ 9 − 14 × 2 = ?</p>\n\n<p>Now, if ‘+’ and ‘–‘ are interchanged, and ‘×’ and ‘÷’ are interchanged, then:</p>\n\n<p>⇒ 25 – 3 × 9 + 14 ÷ 2 = ? ⇒ 25 – 27 + 7 = ? ⇒ 25 + 7 - 27 = ? ⇒ 32 - 27 = 5.</p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
