          "id": "D",
          "text": "124",
          "html": "124"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Given equation: 63 × 7 ÷ 13 − 64 + 42 = ?</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">After interchanging the signs then:</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ <u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">63 <span style=\"text-align: center;\">÷</span> 7</span></u> × 13 + 64 - 42 =  ⇒  <u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">9 ×</span></u><u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"> 13</span></u> + 64 - 42 ⇒  <u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">117 + 64</span></u> - 42<br />\n⇒<strong><u>181 - 42</u></strong> = 139</p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
