    {
      "id": "f9e531a77554-q22",
      "number": 22,
      "question": "If &lsquo;A & Z&rsquo; means &lsquo;A is the brother of Z&rsquo;, &lsquo;A # Z&rsquo; means &lsquo;A is the sister of Z&rsquo;, &lsquo;A ^ Z&rsquo; means &lsquo;A is the brother of Z&rsquo;s father&rsquo;, &lsquo;A @ Z&rsquo; means &lsquo;A is the wife of Z&rsquo;, &lsquo;A % Z&rsquo; means &lsquo;A is the mother of Z&rsquo;, &lsquo;A &alpha; Z&rsquo; means &lsquo;A is the father of Z&rsquo;, then how is J related to Z in the following expression? J % K # L @ M &alpha; N & Z",
      "questionHtml": "If<br />\n&lsquo;A &amp; Z&rsquo; means &lsquo;A is the brother of Z&rsquo;,<br />\n&lsquo;A # Z&rsquo; means &lsquo;A is the sister of Z&rsquo;,<br />\n&lsquo;A ^ Z&rsquo; means &lsquo;A is the brother of Z&rsquo;s father&rsquo;,<br />\n&lsquo;A @ Z&rsquo; means &lsquo;A is the wife of Z&rsquo;,<br />\n&lsquo;A % Z&rsquo; means &lsquo;A is the mother of Z&rsquo;,<br />\n&lsquo;A &alpha; Z&rsquo; means &lsquo;A is the father of Z&rsquo;,<br />\nthen how is J related to Z in the following expression?<br />\nJ % K # L @ M &alpha; N &amp; Z",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Mother",
          "html": "Mother"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Father&rsquo;s mother",
          "html": "<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Father&rsquo;s mother</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Mother&rsquo;s sister",
          "html": "<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Mother&rsquo;s sister</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Mother&rsquo;s mother",
          "html": "<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Mother&rsquo;s mother</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">J is the mother of K, K is the sister of L, L is the wife of M, M is the father of N and N is the brother of Z.</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/25/07/F1_Dolly_SSC_26_7_D55.png\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 265px; height: 205px;\" />​</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">S, J is the <span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Mother’s mother </span>of Z.</p>\n",
