      "solution": "<p>After arranged in alphabetical order,</p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 300px;\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Alphabets</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">D</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">I</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">C</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">T</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">I</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">O</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">N</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">A</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">R</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Y</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Alphabetical order</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">A</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">C</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">D</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">I</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">I</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">N</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">O</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">R</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">T</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Y</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>Fourth alphabet from the left end is: I and second alphabet from the right end is: T,</p>\n\n<p>And, there are 10 letters between I and T.</p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 300px;\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">I</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">J</span></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">K</span></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">L</span></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">M</span></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">N</span></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">O</span></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">P</span></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Q</span></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">R</span></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>S</strong></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">T</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n",
